### Claude Code ###
# Ignore the *contents* of .claude/, not the directory. `.claude/` with a
# trailing slash excludes the directory itself, and git refuses to re-include
# anything beneath an excluded directory — which would make every negation
# below a silent no-op.
.claude/*
__pycache__/

# Shared project tooling, deliberately tracked:
!.claude/context-digest.py
!.claude/settings.json

# Still ignored: settings.local.json (personal permission grants),
# plus anything else Claude Code drops in here.
